     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Fado",
     "texto": [
      "**fado** is a genre of music and poetry associated with Lisbon; there is also fado from Coimbra. It's usually accompanied by the Portuguese guitar. Its lyrics deal with varied themes, such as **saudade**, love and daily life; it is not always sad. In **ouve-se fado**, the listener is not named."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Student and carnival traditions",
     "texto": [
      "The **Queima das Fitas** is an academic festivity associated with Coimbra, usually in spring; the dates change. The **Carnaval de Torres Vedras** is known for its parades. The **Açores** and **Madeira** are Portuguese archipelagos."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
